{"ticker":"SNDK","updated":"2026-11-14T01:25:53Z","profile":{"longName":"Sandisk Corporation","shortName":"Sandisk Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","country":"United States","website":"https://www.sandisk.com","fullTimeEmployees":11100,"marketCap":125927505920,"trailingPE":7.0732894,"forwardPE":3.0617468,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.3466744,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":2047.375,"targetHighPrice":3000.0,"targetLowPrice":870.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":3.779,"earningsGrowth":69.133,"grossMargins":0.79952,"operatingMargins":0.7268,"profitMargins":0.67039,"totalRevenue":28970999808,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":2354.39,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":183.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Sandisk Corporation develops, manufactures, and sells data storage devices and solutions using NAND flash technology in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Asia, and internationally. The company provides solid state drives for desktop and notebook PCs, gaming consoles, and set top boxes; and flash-based embedded storage products for mobile phones, tablets, notebook PCs and other portable and wearable devices, automotive applications, Internet of Things, industrial, and connected home applications, as well as removable cards, universal serial bus drives, and wafers and components. It sells its products to computer manufacturers and original equipment manufacturers, datacenters, private cloud customers, cloud service providers, resellers, distributors, and retailers through its sales personnel, dealers, distributors, retailers, and subsidiaries. Sandisk Corporation was incorporated in 2024 and is based in Milpitas, California.","summary_zh":"Sandisk Corporation 在美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞洲和國際上開發、製造和銷售使用 NAND 快閃記憶體技術的資料儲存設備和解決方案。該公司為桌上型電腦和筆記型電腦、遊戲機和機上盒提供固態硬碟；用於手機、平板電腦、筆記型電腦和其他便攜式和可穿戴設備、汽車應用、物聯網、工業和互聯家庭應用的快閃記憶體嵌入式儲存產品，以及可移動卡、通用序列匯流排驅動器以及晶圓和組件。它透過其銷售人員、經銷商、分銷商、零售商和子公司向電腦製造商和原始設備製造商、資料中心、私有雲客戶、雲端服務提供商、經銷商、分銷商和零售商銷售其產品。 Sandisk Corporation 成立於 2024 年，總部位於加州米爾皮塔斯。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電腦硬體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":85.3,"h":92.055,"l":85.12,"c":90.09,"v":8981300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":90.31,"h":93.13,"l":89.56,"c":91.55,"v":6292100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":90.775,"h":94.81,"l":90.22,"c":93.97,"v":7031000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":97.3,"h":102.93,"l":96.858,"c":98.87,"v":9441900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":98.0,"h":102.99,"l":96.71,"c":102.21,"v":6459900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":105.76,"h":108.8,"l":101.59,"c":102.92,"v":7692200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":105.0,"h":110.21,"l":104.7,"c":106.4,"v":7835000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":103.555,"h":107.72,"l":96.631,"c":99.83,"v":12409300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":96.265,"h":100.45,"l":93.535,"c":94.29,"v":10569300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":96.0,"h":99.646,"l":94.39,"c":97.12,"v":6418000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":104.25,"h":114.0,"l":103.348,"c":113.5,"v":12435400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":114.1,"h":120.74,"l":112.11,"c":112.2,"v":11414800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":113.06,"h":123.85,"l":112.0,"c":121.12,"v":12237400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":128.69,"h":132.29,"l":123.26,"c":124.14,"v":9453400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":128.29,"h":137.05,"l":126.7,"c":128.41,"v":10193700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":133.6,"h":134.79,"l":119.29,"c":121.17,"v":9963900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":125.2,"h":125.2,"l":115.68,"c":120.95,"v":6594600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":121.5,"h":132.28,"l":120.2,"c":131.88,"v":7173400},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":127.0,"h":131.605,"l":126.12,"c":129.68,"v":3561500},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":131.46,"h":132.0,"l":116.17,"c":116.91,"v":7860200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":129.74,"h":135.91,"l":124.048,"c":134.61,"v":8297300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":123.59,"h":130.48,"l":120.96,"c":127.29,"v":7078600},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":134.75,"h":144.55,"l":130.5,"c":144.3,"v":8971100},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":146.0,"h":149.09,"l":141.7,"c":144.27,"v":6289600},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":139.22,"h":150.82,"l":136.29,"c":140.16,"v":8279800},{"t":